        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="The shopper taps Pay on the cart. customer-bff calls PlaceOrder over gRPC and waits for authorize_url, or for nothing on a wallet order. Nothing on this path is Kafka, so there is no Ack.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1">
