        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-37" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="600" x="1100" y="952" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-38" parent="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-37" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc PlaceOrder(PlaceOrderRequest) returns (PlaceOrderResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message PlaceOrderRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string idempotency_key&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 1;  // uuid, made by the app&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64&amp;nbsp; cart_version&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 2;  // the cart the shopper saw&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64&amp;nbsp; expected_total_satang = 3;  // the total the shopper saw&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string payment_method&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 4;  // card | promptpay | qr | wallet&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string quote_id&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 5;  // delivery only, from Quote&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;// store_id, channel, service_mode, and lines&lt;br&gt;// come from the cart (LLD 7)&lt;br&gt;message PlaceOrderResponse {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string order_id&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string status&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; = 2;    // pending_payment&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string authorize_url = 3;    // empty for wallet&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64&amp;nbsp; total_satang&amp;nbsp; = 4;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;price_changed: FAILED_PRECONDITION, the app re-reads&lt;br&gt;the cart with GetCart and shows the new total.&lt;br&gt;metadata: x-brand-id · x-principal-id · traceparent" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="568" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-39" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="1716" y="952" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-40" parent="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-39" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="orders&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order_id PK · brand_id · store_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;customer_id · channel · service_mode&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · version · menu_version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;total_satang · currency&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;quote_id · delivery_satang&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;idempotency_key  UNIQUE(brand_id, key)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;transaction_id · cart_version · created_at&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UNIQUE(brand_id, customer_id)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;WHERE status = pending_payment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;order_lines&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order_id · sku_id · qty&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;unit_satang · modifiers jsonb&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox: only when a pending order is superseded:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment.requested{void} · order.events{cancelled}&lt;br&gt;order.events{placed} leaves only after&lt;br&gt;payment.events{authorized} (LLD 2),&lt;br&gt;which also deletes the cart." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-41" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="2142" y="952" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-42" parent="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-41" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Dedupe: UNIQUE(brand_id, idempotency_key). A repeat returns the stored response, even after a crash.&lt;br&gt;• Order passes order_id as the idempotency_key to Payment, so one order has one charge.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline: set by customer-bff and passed down. ResolveStore, PriceLines, GetQuote, and CreateTransaction share it (budget is O-02).&lt;br&gt;• One pending order per brand and customer. A new key supersedes the old order in the same commit: it is cancelled and its hold voided (P-32).&lt;br&gt;• Retry: the app retries UNAVAILABLE with the same key. Order does not retry inside the call.&lt;br&gt;• Two hops from the BFF: Order to Brand &amp;amp; Store, Catalog, Delivery, and Payment." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-43" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="460" x="2568" y="952" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-44" parent="Y4fNj4JRgwEIP1DTWB_6-43" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Steps 2–7 run inside one gRPC call. The shopper waits on all of them.&lt;br&gt;• D-02: Order is the only caller of CreateTransaction for an order.&lt;br&gt;• D-07: the store is checked live; Order keeps no copy.&lt;br&gt;• P-01 idempotency_key · P-09 placed after authorized · P-10 sweeper.&lt;br&gt;• Price lines are the order’s record of what the shopper pays, used by the receipt, refunds, and loyalty.&lt;br&gt;• P-22: Delivery owns the quote. The fee on the order is the fee quoted.&lt;br&gt;• D-09 · P-16: a wallet order is one tender behind Payment. Payment holds at once, so there is no URL; placed still waits for payment.events{authorized}.&lt;br&gt;• P-32: PlaceOrder checks out the cart. The shopper never pays a total they did not see.&lt;br&gt;• Status names are draft." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="428" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="2 · payment.events consumer" id="lld-1">
