        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-32" parent="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-31" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="topic payment.events   key brand_id:transaction_id&lt;br&gt;headers event_id · event_type · brand_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;occurred_at · version · traceparent&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message PaymentEvent {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string transaction_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string order_id       = 2;   // empty for a top-up&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string purpose        = 3;   // order | top_up&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  amount_satang  = 4;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;oneof event {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Authorized authorized = 10;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Failed     failed     = 11;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Captured   captured   = 12;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Voided     voided     = 13;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Refunded   refunded   = 14;  // Order ignores&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;}&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message Failed { string reason = 1; }" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="568" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-33" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="1024" y="1308" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-34" parent="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-33" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="orders&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment_version = record.version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox (same transaction)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order.events{placed}     on authorized&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order.events{cancelled}  on failed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;reason = payment_failed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;carts: delete on placed,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;if version = orders.cart_version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pos_job row              on placed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;processed by: Outbox relay, POS worker" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-35" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="1450" y="1308" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-36" parent="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-35" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Fact, so dedupe on version: apply only when record.version &amp;gt; orders.payment_version.&lt;br&gt;• purpose = top_up is not an order: Ack with no work.&lt;br&gt;• Ack = commit the offset after the Postgres commit. Auto-commit is off.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff inside the app, then order.dlq, then Ack.&lt;br&gt;• The relay can publish a row twice after a crash; every order.events consumer dedupes on version." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-37" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="460" x="1876" y="1308" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-38" parent="IR2pni44WlJNj3Vr41bI-37" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-09: placed means the kitchen may see it, so it waits for authorized.&lt;br&gt;• Notification messages a payment failure from order.events{cancelled}, never from payment.events{failed}.&lt;br&gt;• O-05 is open: what to do when capture fails after the kitchen accepted.&lt;br&gt;• P-05 relay · P-06 consumer rules." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="428" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
