        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-41" parent="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-40" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="message Create {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string channel          = 1;  // grab | lineman | shopee&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string external_order_id = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string store_id         = 3;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string service_mode     = 4;  // delivery | pickup&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;repeated AggLine lines  = 5;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  total_satang     = 6;  // what the aggregator charged&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  placed_at_unix   = 7;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message AggLine {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string external_sku = 1;  string sku_id = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int32  qty = 3;           int64 unit_satang = 4;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;repeated string modifier_ids = 5;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;order_id = uuid made by partner-adapter, kept for&lt;br&gt;the external id, so replace and cancel share the key" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="568" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-42" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="1808" y="1076" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-43" parent="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-42" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="processed_event  event_id PK&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;orders&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;channel · external_order_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UNIQUE(brand_id, channel, external_order_id)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status = placed · version 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;order_lines  from the aggregator payload&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox (same transaction)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order.events{placed}&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pos_job" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-44" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="410" x="2234" y="1076" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-45" parent="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-44" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Command, so dedupe on event_id, plus UNIQUE(channel, external_order_id) for a webhook the aggregator sends twice.&lt;br&gt;• Key brand_id:order_id keeps create, replace, and cancel in order.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff, then order.dlq, then Ack." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="378" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-46" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="460" x="2660" y="1076" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-47" parent="qEjAEAxFA6xkgXvR7xVr-46" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-09: aggregator orders are placed at create, because the aggregator took the money.&lt;br&gt;• No Payment call and no payment.requested on this path.&lt;br&gt;• Price lines come from the aggregator payload (draft, to align with the business).&lt;br&gt;• Notification skips aggregator orders; the aggregator messages its own shopper." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="344" width="428" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
